  "name": {
    "en": "A6 Europe Motorway"
  },
  "description": {
    "en": "Approximately 63 km from Sofia to the Serbian border at Kalotina, on European route E80 and Pan-European Corridor X. It was called the Kalotina motorway until it was renamed in 2018. Dragoman–Slivnitsa was built by GBS-Infrastructure and opened in November 2020; Kalotina–Dragoman went to Strabag in a tender awarded in September 2017. The associated Sofia Northern Bypass opened in April 2016."
  },
